# A Feather in One's Cap (windurst 1): the order of its arms in Baren-Moren's one if-chain. Hat in Hand completed, this
# quest available, Windurst fame level 3 (125), no needToZone and the repeat var QuestFeatherInOnesCap_var 1 (a GM): the
# offer's 75 (0, 842) comes first (Baren-Moren.lua:51-57 before the reminder's 78 at :58-62); finished with option 0:
# nothing.
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=-65.0,-2.9,-145.7 job=WAR lvl=75
fame Windurst 125
quest Windurst.HatInHand completed
charvar QuestFeatherInOnesCap_var 1
login
trigger Baren-Moren                     # available, the offer's conditions met, the var 1: 75 (0, 842), not 78
finish option=0                         # nothing
